graph LR
    SRC[Source<br/>Position/Cash] -->|reduce| TG{transfer_group_id}
    TG -->|increase| DST[Destination<br/>Position/Cash]
    TG -->|both legs| ADJ[is_adjustment = true<br/>S&P ignores]

    style SRC fill:#ef4444,color:#fff,stroke:#dc2626
    style TG fill:#06b6d4,color:#fff,stroke:#0891b2
    style DST fill:#22c55e,color:#fff,stroke:#16a34a
    style ADJ fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff,stroke:#d97706
